sentences.text:
By the impugned Judgment and Order, the Appellant was convicted as follows ;
(a) He was convicted for commission of offence punishable u/s 363 of the Indian Penal Code and was sentenced to suffer rigorous imprisonment of 3 years and to pay a fine of Rs.2,000/- and in default of payment of fine to suffer simple imprisonment for two months.
(b) He was also convicted u/s 366A of the Indian Penal Code and was sentenced to suffer rigorous imprisonment of five years and to pay a fine of Rs.3,000/- and in default of payment of fine to suffer simple imprisonment for three months.
